{"unit_id":"gxpppp__dsh-search-mcp#card-zh","repo":"gxpppp/dsh-search-mcp","commit":"ae3a247aa104c952f720736cb4dfa3f024f01551","type":"card","lang":"zh","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:58-68","cordis.patch.yml:32-37","lib/catalog.js:8-79","lib/provider.js:36-51","lib/client.browser.js:676-818"],"text":"**dsh-search-mcp**（DSH 网页插件）：将 DSH 的 web_search 接入搜索 MCP 服务器。插件注册 search-mcp provider 并由 bundle 切换内置 provider；设置面板可管理 Tavily、Brave、Exa、Perplexity、DuckDuckGo 或自定义 HTTP/stdio 服务，选择默认服务器、设置结果上限和超时，并把 MCP 响应整理为来源。适合需要更换网页搜索服务的 DSH Web 用户；部分服务需要 API key，DuckDuckGo 预设无需密钥。"}
{"unit_id":"gxpppp__dsh-search-mcp#card-en","repo":"gxpppp/dsh-search-mcp","commit":"ae3a247aa104c952f720736cb4dfa3f024f01551","type":"card","lang":"en","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:58-68","cordis.patch.yml:32-37","lib/catalog.js:8-79","lib/provider.js:36-51","lib/client.browser.js:676-818"],"text":"**dsh-search-mcp** routes DSH web search through MCP servers. Its web settings panel offers five provider presets or custom HTTP/stdio servers, plus controls for the default server, result limit, and timeout. MCP responses become search sources. Some providers require an API key."}
